Subject: [PATCH] HD1: headers sized as headers (AC98; AC80, AC81, AC85, AC91
 (f), AC92 (d), AC94 noted)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Screen titles 600 28 px and sheet titles 600 20 px at the tokens' line heights; section and
sheet-block heads 600 15 px --ink; lane heads, a group's name, run heads, the Timeline's goal
labels, Plan's card label and "More detail"'s sub-heads 600 13 px, each keeping its colour; an
opened phase's two group heads 600 12 px; the empty section's line 500 13 px (--t-row) --ink2.
"Since you last looked · <time>" and "Milestones by phase · <count>" split at their first " · "
in sandbox.js, the small part in --t-small --ink2 and a clock time in Plex Mono 400 12 px. Every
token's value unchanged; every new rule in mockup v2's block.

Tests: AC98's own (tests/desk/ac98-headers.test.mjs); the locked cases HD1 changes rewritten,
each marked "Rewritten in HD1"; the stage-8 guard's pins whose after-value HD1 changes rewritten
to HD1's look, and HD1_ONCE for the rest, met exactly.

