+// each kind, and a v2.5 project in `poom/`'s placeholder form), `md-extremes/` (sandbox-fixtures.mjs's five made-up projects),
+// Service-Desk with J12's built pull requests, and Plan's made-up estimates (wa-fixtures.mjs) — and the states the walk does not
