+// checked by selector: its computed size, weight and colour; the kept-small roles, each measured, unchanged; the tokens'
+// values unchanged; and the two headings' small part. The stage-8 guard's exception for HD1 is AC88's test's
+// (tests/desk/ac88-dark.test.mjs, `HD1_ONCE`); the Chromium captures at 360 × 740 and 414 × 896 are the pull request's.
